  evidence:
  - evidence_type: CURATOR_JUDGMENT
    source: https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=525; https://togomedium.org/medium/M526
    notes: JCM525 explicitly prepares a suspension using 10 g chalcopyrite and 500
      ml water, while its comments allow arsenopyrite or pyrite replacement. The frozen
      occurrence does not select an alternative version. This source-defined suspension
      retains the alternatives without asserting mineral equivalence or all three
      minerals as simultaneous parts. Only water is asserted as a common retained
      part; no final-volume concentration is derived. No verified exact eligible ontology
      term or existing whole-preparation owner was established by the bounded source/owner
      review. This self-registry mapping represents the preparation, not its individual
      constituents.
